WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.539 --> 00:00:06.649
You may or may not be aware that Donald Trump
is suffering yet another major loss to his

00:00:06.649 --> 00:00:07.649
administration.

00:00:07.649 --> 00:00:10.200
This time it's the director of national intelligence.

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:15.429
Dan Coats, coats is resigning and as usual
there's this question of whether is it really

00:00:15.429 --> 00:00:17.500
a resignation or is it a firing?

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.860
Because Trump's relationship with the intelligence
community has been pretty disastrous since

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:26.930
day one and Dan Coats is one of those people
who when he testifies before Congress and

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:31.730
is asked basic questions like, did Russia
interfere in our elections?

00:00:31.730 --> 00:00:34.930
He goes with what the evidence has told the
intelligence community.

00:00:34.930 --> 00:00:36.350
The answer is yes.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:39.070
That's not a position that Donald Trump likes.

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:45.030
And it appears as though removing Dan coats
is yet another way to pave the way to not

00:00:45.030 --> 00:00:51.010
stop foreign interference in 2022 ignore the
attacks on our democratic systems, which is

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:56.870
exactly what Donald Trump and Mitch McConnell
have made it super clear they want to be doing

00:00:56.870 --> 00:01:04.720
for 2020 Mitch McConnell getting in the way
of every uh, bill or proposal met to stop

00:01:04.720 --> 00:01:06.650
foreign interference in our election.

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:08.900
So coats is going out.

00:01:08.900 --> 00:01:15.900
Trump has nominated republican congressman
John Ratcliffe who truly knows nothing about

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:21.530
being the director of national intelligence
and has no business being the DNI.

00:01:21.530 --> 00:01:26.229
This is, I mean, language starts to lose its
meaning.

00:01:26.229 --> 00:01:29.910
It's a stunning choice and to call something
stunning in the Trump administration.

00:01:29.910 --> 00:01:33.790
The Trump era is a sort of limited meanings
since we are stunned.

00:01:33.790 --> 00:01:40.500
Day after day, a Democratic Senator Ron Wyden,
is calling him the least qualified individual

00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:47.050
ever to be nominated to be DNI and says that
Ratcliffe could straight up put people people's

00:01:47.050 --> 00:01:48.220
lives at risk.

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:54.210
Check out a couple of tweets where Ron Wyden
says, congressman Ratcliff is the most partisan

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:57.860
and least qualified individual ever nominated
to serve as DNI.

00:01:57.860 --> 00:02:02.810
His only qualification seem to be promoting
Trump's conspiracy theories about the investigation

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:07.930
into Russian interference and calling for
prosecution of Trump's political enemies continuing.

00:02:07.930 --> 00:02:13.840
He has endorsed government surveillance and
shown little concern for Americans' rights

00:02:13.840 --> 00:02:18.290
except for those of Trump and his close associates
confirming this individual would amount to

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:24.310
an endorsement of this administration's drive
to politicize our intelligence agencies.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:30.129
Putting in place a director of national intelligence
who has repeated baseless conspiracy theories

00:02:30.129 --> 00:02:35.359
about the Russia probe that have been widely
debunked by the intelligence community is

00:02:35.359 --> 00:02:37.129
disgusting and embarrassing.

00:02:37.129 --> 00:02:42.709
He senselessly and embarrassingly berated
former special prosecutor Robert Muller last

00:02:42.709 --> 00:02:48.230
week during the congressional testimony, if
you wanted to destroy the American intelligence

00:02:48.230 --> 00:02:55.019
apparatus from the inside out, if you had
the goal of weakening our intelligence community,

00:02:55.019 --> 00:02:57.700
this is exactly who you would select.

00:02:57.700 --> 00:03:03.290
A Republican conspiracy theorist who has spread
fake news and false intelligence.

00:03:03.290 --> 00:03:08.909
It is really difficult to be less qualified
than Donald Trump's education secretary Betsy

00:03:08.909 --> 00:03:10.900
devos, and yet here we are.

00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:17.540
I think that this guy actually surpasses Betsy
devoss as not qualified for his position.

00:03:17.540 --> 00:03:22.590
And when you look at the reaction of this
from foreign intelligence agencies, the intelligence

00:03:22.590 --> 00:03:28.760
agencies of foreign nations are drooling about
this because it will laughably weaken the

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.170
United States.

00:03:30.170 --> 00:03:32.090
It will make us more vulnerable.

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:38.719
And I wish I could say that our Senate will
do its job and prevent this clown from being

00:03:38.719 --> 00:03:40.599
confirmed to the roll.

00:03:40.599 --> 00:03:42.230
I don't know that they will.

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:45.700
I don't know that they will remember that
Republicans control the Senate and thus they

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:50.459
control the committees that ultimately decide
about these nominations.

00:03:50.459 --> 00:03:54.079
And I don't know that they are going to put
a stop to this.

00:03:54.079 --> 00:03:55.329
It's disgusting.

00:03:55.329 --> 00:03:56.590
It's embarrassing.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:04:02.719
It is a handout to our adversaries, but it
seems to be a feature of Donald Trump's selection,

00:04:02.719 --> 00:04:08.150
not a bug, that this is a guy that would effectively
unwind the intelligence community from the

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:09.280
inside out.

00:04:09.280 --> 00:04:12.909
And the world is laughing and your life and
my life and the lives

00:04:12.909 --> 00:04:18.310
of so many people in this country are potentially
at risk as a result of this choice.

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:20.070
Trump will probably get his guy in.

00:04:20.070 --> 00:04:52.120
We'll take a quick break

00:04:52.120 --> 00:05:06.400
and

00:05:06.400 --> 00:05:20.280
be

00:05:20.280 --> 00:05:34.080
back

